menu "Pajoniiir UI"

config UI_DJUI_DIRECT_STRIPS
    bool "Blit the dj_ui zoom strips straight to the framebuffer (PPA)"
    default y
    help
        v287. The two zoom waveform strips leave LVGL's draw path: after each
        LVGL refresh the bridge burns the playhead, cue triangle and armed-loop
        trail into its ring strip and the PPA copies the view into the
        framebuffer. Off: LVGL draws them as images, as in v286.

        dj_ui is the only presentation layer since v293 (UI migration
        phase 6, docs/UI_MIGRATION_PLAN_DJUI.md); the former
        UI_PRESENTATION_DJUI switch and the legacy widgets are gone.

endmenu
